      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01201",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "\"嘿，你别怨我呀。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Hey, don't hold it against me.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01201",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "我所以不得不打出这一手，完全是你自作自受的结果。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The reason I had no choice but to make this move is entirely that you brought it on yourself.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01201",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "不去说它了。\"",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Let's not talk about it anymore.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01201",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "他说着从兜里掏出了一个印有鹿苑寺字样的信封，数了数钞票。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As he spoke, he took from his pocket an envelope printed with the words Rokuonji Temple and counted the banknotes.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01201",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "钞票是今年正月发行的崭新的千元票。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The banknotes were brand-new thousand-yen bills issued at New Year this year.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01201",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "只有三张。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There were only three of them.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01201",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "我说：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I said:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
